================================================================================================
COMPLETE WALK MODEL — mixer + W gate + imprint, exact construction
================================================================================================
  R=0.6, dt=0.5, k=15, 65536 shots. P(y) ~ || |psi_y> - sum_x V_yx
  U_t |psi_x> ||^2, built on the joint param(x)sys space. No fitting.
  'floor' is TVD between two simulator runs at different seeds - the
  prediction is validated only if TVD pred is comparable to it.

          problem blk  n  TVD pred    floor  TVD unif    corr   ratio
  -------------------------------------------------------------------
       MaxCut N=4   0  4    0.0091   0.0092    0.3090  0.9998    1.00
       MaxCut N=4   1  4    0.1184   0.0116    0.1958  0.7729   10.20
       MaxCut N=4   2  4    0.0082   0.0098    0.3355  0.9999    0.84
       MaxCut N=4   3  4    0.1407   0.0109    0.1596  0.4279   12.93
   Heisenberg N=4   0  4    0.1214   0.0144    0.2586  0.9935    8.43
   Heisenberg N=4   1  4    0.3071   0.0150    0.1660  0.4417   20.41
   Heisenberg N=4   2  4    0.1799   0.0125    0.1413  0.9243   14.40
   Heisenberg N=4   3  4    0.2818   0.0154    0.2694  0.4785   18.28

  ratio near 1 means the prediction is as close to the simulator as the
  simulator is to itself - a complete model. Large ratio with high corr
  means the SHAPE is right and something scales it. Large ratio with low
  corr means the model is still missing structure, and the next suspect is
  the walk unitary's ordering or the anc=1 branch algebra rather than the
  Gram overlaps, since those are now included exactly.
